### Testar lista de consultas
GET http://localhost:3333/api/consultas
Accept: application/json

### Testar criar consulta
POST http://localhost:3333/api/consultas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idPaciente": 1,
  "idMedico": 1,
  "dataHora": "2026-05-10T14:30:00",
  "modalidade": "Pessoalmente",
  "triagemSintomas": "Consulta de rotina"
}

### Testar buscar consulta por ID
GET http://localhost:3333/api/consultas/1
Accept: application/json

### Testar atualizar consulta
PUT http://localhost:3333/api/consultas/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idPaciente": 1,
  "idMedico": 1,
  "dataHora": "2026-05-10T15:00:00",
  "modalidade": "Teleconsulta",
  "triagemSintomas": "Consulta de rotina - Alterada"
}

### Testar deletar consulta
DELETE http://localhost:3333/api/consultas/1
Accept: application/json
